        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "White cotton yarn canvas covered, except at the edges, by white and polychrome wool yarns worked mainly in tent stitch. Six horizontal rows, one above the other, with the upper and lower case alphabets, placed alternately, in succession, and the numbers 1-10.    Ground worn through in spots; missing yarns; slightly soiled.  Stitches: tent, upright bobelein."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/505eb8e2-22f2-31f4-9753-d6cb36e6d03a> ;
